  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRENA &#x2013; Voluntary contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRENA&#x2019;s mission is to play a leading role in the ongoing transformation of the global energy systems as a centre of excellence for knowledge and innovation, a global voice of renewable energy, a network hub for all stakeholders and a source of advice and support for countries. IRENA&#x2019;s Medium-term Strategy places particular focus on enabling policy, regulatory and technical frameworks, and business models and financing instruments.</narrative>
  </description>
